  {
    "group": "How it is built",
    "items": [
      {
        "text": "Java 17 is the project Java version, and CI builds with JDK 17.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:pom.xml:30",
            "quote": "<java.version>17</java.version>"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:.github/workflows/maven-build.yml:18",
            "quote": "java: [ '17' ]"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Maven multi-module build: a parent pom of packaging pom lists eight modules (admin, customers, vets, visits, genai, config, discovery, api-gateway).",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:pom.xml:16",
            "quote": "<packaging>pom</packaging>"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:pom.xml:24",
            "quote": "<module>spring-petclinic-config-server</module>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Spring Boot 4.0.1 parent with Spring Cloud 2025.1.0.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:pom.xml:9",
            "quote": "<version>4.0.1</version>"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:pom.xml:32",
            "quote": "<spring-cloud.version>2025.1.0</spring-cloud.version>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "CI is a GitHub Actions workflow that runs a Maven package build on push and pull request to main.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:.github/workflows/maven-build.yml:4",
            "quote": "name: Java CI with Maven"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:.github/workflows/maven-build.yml:29",
            "quote": "mvn -B package --file pom.xml"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "group": "How it ships and runs",
    "items": [
      {
        "text": "Docker images are built with the buildDocker Maven profile (<code>./mvnw clean install -P buildDocker</code>) from one shared docker/Dockerfile and tagged springcommunity/&lt;artifactId&gt;.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:README.md:36",
            "quote": "./mvnw clean install -P buildDocker"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:pom.xml:195",
            "quote": "${docker.image.prefix}/${project.artifactId}"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:pom.xml:37",
            "quote": "<docker.image.prefix>springcommunity</docker.image.prefix>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The shared Dockerfile is a two-stage build on eclipse-temurin:17 that extracts Spring Boot layers and starts with JarLauncher; it sets SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=docker.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:docker/Dockerfile:1",
            "quote": "FROM eclipse-temurin:17 AS builder"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:docker/Dockerfile:14",
            "quote": "ENV SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=docker"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:docker/Dockerfile:28",
            "quote": "JarLauncher"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "docker-compose.yml runs config-server, discovery-server, customers, visits, vets, genai, api-gateway, tracing-server (zipkin), admin-server, grafana-server and prometheus-server. Databases are not part of compose.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:docker-compose.yml:2",
            "quote": "config-server:"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:docker-compose.yml:143",
            "quote": "grafana-server:"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:docker-compose.yml:153",
            "quote": "prometheus-server:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Startup order: discovery-server waits for a healthy config-server; customers, visits, vets, genai, api-gateway and admin-server wait for both config-server and discovery-server to be healthy (depends_on condition service_healthy). Tracing, Grafana and Prometheus have no depends_on.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:docker-compose.yml:30",
            "quote": "config-server:"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:docker-compose.yml:31",
            "quote": "condition: service_healthy"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:docker-compose.yml:137",
            "quote": "condition: service_healthy"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Published ports: api-gateway 8080, customers 8081, visits 8082, vets 8083, genai 8084, config-server 8888, discovery-server 8761, admin-server 9090, zipkin 9411, Grafana 3030 (container 3000), Prometheus 9091 (container 9090).",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:docker-compose.yml:114",
            "quote": "8080:8080"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:docker-compose.yml:15",
            "quote": "8888:8888"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:docker-compose.yml:33",
            "quote": "8761:8761"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:docker-compose.yml:139",
            "quote": "9090:9090"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:docker-compose.yml:151",
            "quote": "3030:3000"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Every compose container has a memory limit (512M for the Java services and Zipkin, 256M for Grafana and Prometheus).",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:docker-compose.yml:8",
            "quote": "memory: 512M"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:docker-compose.yml:149",
            "quote": "memory: 256M"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "group": "Configuration",
    "items": [
      {
        "text": "Each service imports its config with spring.config.import: optional:configserver:${CONFIG_SERVER_URL:http://localhost:8888/} by default and configserver:http://config-server:8888 under the docker profile.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:spring-petclinic-customers-service/src/main/resources/application.yml:5",
            "quote": "${CONFIG_SERVER_URL:http://localhost:8888/}"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:spring-petclinic-customers-service/src/main/resources/application.yml:13",
            "quote": "import: configserver:http://config-server:8888"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Config server serves from the git repo spring-petclinic-microservices-config (default label main). Setting the native profile and GIT_REPO switches to a local file-system backend.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:spring-petclinic-config-server/src/main/resources/application.yml:7",
            "quote": "spring-petclinic/spring-petclinic-microservices-config"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:spring-petclinic-config-server/src/main/resources/application.yml:9",
            "quote": "Use the File System Backend to avoid git pulling"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:spring-petclinic-config-server/src/main/resources/application.yml:11",
            "quote": "searchLocations: file:///${GIT_REPO}"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The config repo has a shared application.yml plus one file per service name (admin-server, api-gateway, customers-service, discovery-server, genai-service, tracing-server, vets-service, visits-service).",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices-config:application.yml:1",
            "quote": "# COMMON APPLICATION PROPERTIES"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices-config:vets-service.yml:22",
            "quote": "port: 8083"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices-config:visits-service.yml:16",
            "quote": "port: 8082"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "By default services start on a random port (server.port 0); under the docker profile customers, visits, vets and genai fix their ports (8081 to 8084); the gateway, discovery-server, config-server and admin-server ports are fixed in all profiles.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices-config:application.yml:4",
            "quote": "start services on random port by default"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices-config:genai-service.yml:16",
            "quote": "port: 8084"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Spring profiles: docker (set in the Dockerfile), mysql (switches datasource to a MySQL URL and the db/mysql scripts, in the shared config), chaos-monkey (enables Chaos Monkey; run_all.sh --chaos-monkey passes it), native (config-server file backend).",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices-config:application.yml:98",
            "quote": "on-profile: mysql"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices-config:application.yml:71",
            "quote": "on-profile: chaos-monkey"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:scripts/run_all.sh:81",
            "quote": "--spring.profiles.active=chaos-monkey"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:README.md:174",
            "quote": "ENV SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE docker,mysql"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Shared config exposes all actuator endpoints and enables the Prometheus metrics export; the Zipkin endpoint under the docker profile is http://tracing-server:9411/api/v2/spans.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices-config:application.yml:32",
            "quote": "management.endpoints.web.exposure.include"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices-config:application.yml:92",
            "quote": "http://tracing-server:9411/api/v2/spans"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Prometheus scrapes itself and four services (api-gateway, customers, visits, vets) at /actuator/prometheus; genai-service and admin-server are not listed.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:docker/prometheus/prometheus.yml:12",
            "quote": "['localhost:9090']"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:docker/prometheus/prometheus.yml:32",
            "quote": "['vets-service:8083']"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "group": "GenAI and vets details",
    "items": [
      {
        "text": "genai-service answers vet questions from an in-memory vector store pre-embedded in <code>vectorstore.json</code>; the live call to vets-service happens only if that file is missing.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:spring-petclinic-genai-service/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/genai/VectorStoreController.java:58",
            "quote": "load(resource)"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:spring-petclinic-genai-service/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/genai/AIDataProvider.java:66",
            "quote": "this.vectorStore.similaritySearch(sr)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Chat memory keeps context across messages (a <code>MessageChatMemoryAdvisor</code> is registered on the chat client).",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:spring-petclinic-genai-service/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/genai/PetclinicChatClient.java:48",
            "quote": "MessageChatMemoryAdvisor.builder(chatMemory)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "vets-service marks <code>GET /vets</code> as cacheable in a cache named <code>vets</code>; <code>@EnableCaching</code> sits in a class active only under the <code>production</code> profile. The service's application.yml makes <code>production</code> the default profile, but the Docker image sets <code>SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=docker</code>, so caching is not on in docker-compose. The config repo sets <code>vets.cache.ttl: 60</code> and <code>heap-size: 100</code>, bound to <code>VetsProperties</code>.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:spring-petclinic-vets-service/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/vets/system/CacheConfig.java:28",
            "quote": "@Profile(\"production\")"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:spring-petclinic-vets-service/src/main/resources/application.yml:7",
            "quote": "cache-names: vets"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices-config:vets-service.yml:3",
            "quote": "ttl: 60"
          },
          {
            "ref": "spring-petclinic-microservices:spring-petclinic-vets-service/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/vets/system/VetsProperties.java:25",
            "quote": "@ConfigurationProperties(prefix = \"vets\")"
